[{"title":"贺新郎 读西寺赵吴兴所书虚照禅师塔铭","author":"黄永","text":"屹尔蹲空碧。\n手摩挲、碑高几丈，大书深勒。\n柳骨颜筋争胜外，别有吴兴笔力。\n看何似、簪花风格。\n人待文传文孰待，待行间、珠玉淋漓墨。\n天下宝、应同惜。\n惊如风雨挥毫夕。\n堪想像、银钩铁画，腕随心得。\n舍利光明同照耀，一片大千虚白。\n曾经几、露痕霜迹。\n师弟名声相上下，问今朝、谁拓虚舟碣。\n骨朽矣、人犹宅。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":6566,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"摸鱼儿 送春","author":"黄永","text":"怪当初、春来何意，今送春归何处。\n游丝绕地漫天絮，顷刻莺花无主。\n留不住。\n那复管、黄鹂啼断斜阳树。\n算谁相顾。\n只纨扇儿郎，红衫小女，饯却东郊路。\n从今后，总任梅黄杏紫，别换一番风雨。\n牡丹亭畔梨花院，也自锦围玉聚。\n空延伫。\n长冷落、王孙宝骑笙歌墅。\n此情休诉。\n羡蝴蝶颠狂，花间栩栩，不问伊来去。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":6567,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"绿头鸭 端午","author":"黄永","text":"趁晴明，恰正是、女儿佳节，双双姊妹相携。\n倩娘梳、牡丹新髻。\n邀郎着、杏子单衣。\n玉茧新裁，红绒细嚼，金钗押衬石榴枝。\n人都道、内家妆束，别样风姿。\n莫迟疑。\n绣旗画楫，逢逢饶鼓来时。\n被花遮、帘前烦恼，惊人觑、背后矜持。\n又何处，清讴檀板，一派好风吹。\n酒后三弦，歌栏十番，谁家浪子拥妖姬。\n忙回避，荡舟归去，说与郎知。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":6568,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"十二时 送史庸庵赴补北上","author":"黄永","text":"先生那得高眠也。\n且为苍生一起。\n正五月、嫩晴天气。\n门外柳浓波翠。\n两载朱幡，三年黄绶，总是心如水。\n骊唱罢，琴鹤萧然，欸乃扁舟，月色江声相倚。\n最牵情，归来曾赋，几点鹭朋鸥伍。\n白社清吟，兰亭高会，事事关人意。\n看纵横、斑管乌丝，疏狂馀几。\n喜今朝，柔乡翠国，别有一番风味。\n月底笙箫，风前兰麝，望里神仙侣。\n只高阳旧伴，醉踏渔舟归去。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":6569,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"玉女摇仙佩 寿巢仪部兼山先生六十","author":"黄永","text":"天衢贵客，粉署仙郎，未老拂衣归去。\n新制荷裳，才成小筑，恰在白云深际。\n看门前流水。\n并楼头明月，萧然佳致。\n更说甚、野间绵蕞，殿上歌呼，叔孙典礼。\n好白眼科头，藤杖芒鞋，山颠水际。\n更有井公园客，金粟洪厓，笑语从容联袂。\n五夜鸾箫，九霄笙鹤，人世繁华无比。\n怪婚男嫁女。\n把向平、早岁良时轻弃。\n问先生、逍遥五岳，旧时都养。\n容吾执御。\n两不负，有巢家世黄熊裔。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":6570,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"闲中好 还书","author":"陈世祥","text":"书空寄，阁着不开封。\n添上侬边泪，还君讶不同。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":6571,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"梦江口 即单调望江南。春尽","author":"陈世祥","text":"春去罢，因甚却关情。\n最是柳丝长不了，何来燕子语偏明。\n怕要下阶行。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":6572,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"南乡子 倦","author":"陈世祥","text":"重门深闭。\n细草如烟烟满砌。\n日长睡起独凭栏。\n看鸳鸯。\n双双飞去又飞还。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":6573,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"西溪子 不至","author":"陈世祥","text":"留得暮云千叶。\n叶叶都成愁结。\n倚高楼，山凝碧。\n人独立。\n待不思量又忆。\n忆成痴。\n月明知。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":6574,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"如梦令 暮春","author":"陈世祥","text":"听说暮春来到。\n不忍见花成草。\n欹枕问巫山，又被莺声唤觉。\n黄鸟。\n黄鸟。\n有个人儿烦恼。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":6575,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"如梦令 睡醒","author":"陈世祥","text":"谁道客愁萧屑。\n偏有梅花交接。\n意味恁幽清，投向诗魂安贴。\n奇绝。\n奇绝。\n又是月光如雪。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":6576,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"如梦令 昨日","author":"陈世祥","text":"花朵朵如人泪。\n一盏酒来竟醉。\n拼醉不教醒，看好时光都废。\n无味。\n无味。\n滑是一团疑谜。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":6577,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"如梦令 席上有赠","author":"陈世祥","text":"听彻玉箫声里。\n字字雨云旖旎。\n醉眼艳层波，散作坐间霞绮。\n倦矣。\n倦矣。\n好向人怀便倚。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":6578,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"如梦令 客中","author":"陈世祥","text":"才看桂花黄絮。\n待趁晚潮归去。\n真正没来由，便把冬春发付。\n还住。\n还住。\n又是紫薇一树。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":6579,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"如梦令 次梅木山夜坐韵","author":"陈世祥","text":"钩月刺开云空。\n帘外紫薇影重。\n我也忆当初，听彻红楼狞凤。\n都梦。\n都梦。\n一样悄然情动。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":6580,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"天仙子 苦雨","author":"陈世祥","text":"织尽雨丝难作匹。\n巡檐一鸟窥人立。\n不知天有几多愁，风恁劈。\n冷云积。\n应缘误发残花檄。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":6581,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"定西番 冬日敬亭宴集","author":"陈世祥","text":"镇日楼头相对，铺月澹，着云轻。\n枕前横。\n踏向棱棱冰壑，水泉流暗声。\n三尺雏松剪剪，似雏僧。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":6582,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"长相思 郊行","author":"陈世祥","text":"开花风。\n落花风。\n酒旗安顿小桥东。\n教人驻玉骢。\n一重溪。\n两重溪。\n弱柳遮藏曲曲篱。\n黄莺独自啼。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":6583,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"相见欢 再晤西若","author":"陈世祥","text":"轻轻飏起娇红。\n小春风。\n迎到栏杆侧畔、出帘栊。\n敛眉语。\n携手步。\n意无穷。\n那时去也魂断、画堂中。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":6584,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"思帝乡 雨不止，逐阻郊游之约","author":"陈世祥","text":"都休。\n留春春也羞。\n树树好花落尽，似清秋。\n怕向楼前望见，休教上玉钩。\n又是垂杨影里、叫鸣鸠。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":6585,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"思帝乡 归思","author":"陈世祥","text":"归休。\n百花香欲流。\n正是浅红柔白，满汀洲。\n好去周旋芳草，风光到处收。\n莫待落花庭院、恼斑鸠。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":6586,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"醉太平 偶见","author":"陈世祥","text":"珊珊玉钩。\n飘飘翠帱。\n倚栏觑见温柔。\n是谁家画楼。\n欲窥又羞。\n欲行又留。\n盼人频转清眸。\n怎教人不愁。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":6587,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"蝴蝶儿 春词","author":"陈世祥","text":"蝴蝶儿。\n拂花枝。\n纱窗小女学新诗。\n拈来微咏之。\n倦则和花睡，双双似有私。\n相看陡地动人思。\n停毫不语时。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":6588,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"昭君怨 春阴久寄姑孰","author":"陈世祥","text":"烟雨萧萧寒重。\n待盼青山成梦。\n梦里是离愁。\n古扬州。\n江水巫山云远。\n寸寸客怀如剪。\n莫要写新诗。\n晚来时。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":6589,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"女冠子 春日","author":"陈世祥","text":"相思独自。\n不及双双燕子。\n镇相怜。\n花影勤催日，炉香懒续烟。\n梦中空有泪，镜里更无言。\n任他飞燕子，不开帘。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":6590,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"点绛唇 闻笛","author":"陈世祥","text":"烟霭全收，远空一色青如削。\n笛声依约。\n向酒肠频掠。\n翻下庭花，字字相思托。\n牵情着。\n月儿将落。\n人在栏杆角。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":6591,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"浣溪纱 午泛归西园","author":"陈世祥","text":"蝶子寻花逐逐忙。\n一溪春绿腻归航。\n杏烟深处读书庄。\n织柳欲成莺衬贴，垒巢未就燕商量。\n迎人小犬出东墙。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":6592,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"浣溪纱 小窗","author":"陈世祥","text":"流水流云入画图。\n画来端的总模糊。\n小窗笔墨太生疏。\n乳燕听时如可解，落花扫去又谁铺。\n焚香整日破工夫。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":6593,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"浣溪纱 阅世说新语","author":"陈世祥","text":"头上还馀漉酒巾。\n庭空不晒宝吾裈。\n庾郎此日未知贫。\n赤玉胸中无宿物，蓝田举体岂常人。\n长卿慢世我思存。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":6594,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"浣溪纱 梦中作","author":"陈世祥","text":"萍子横铺絮一池。\n绿窗正拟落花题。\n一春情事鬓先知。\n未免多情风力倦，可能无恨月容衰。\n扶持好梦与莺儿。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":6595,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"浣溪纱 赠采文","author":"陈世祥","text":"雏笋初齐万绿香。\n参红束素小儿郎。\n生来宜近读书窗。\n沉甲细添箫局火，岕尖鲜试越瓷汤。\n学书教写十三行。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":6596,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"浣溪纱 再示采文","author":"陈世祥","text":"香粉揉成玉琢将。\n憨情嗔态总难忘。\n个侬年纪正思量。\n睡里着惊真觉怯，笑中推酒未全庄。\n悄无人处可相当。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":6597,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"浣溪纱 初夏","author":"陈世祥","text":"只说春归不惹愁。\n辞春还与闷相勾。\n草窠遍地碧如油。\n莺舌已无前日滑，柳腰可似向来柔。\n断肠都在最高楼。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":6598,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"浣溪纱 将雨","author":"陈世祥","text":"莽雾痴云酿宿阴。\n较侬愁绪一般深。\n日长无事费沉吟。\n要顿闲情拈蜡叶，怕粘冷梦熨香衾。\n小窗今夜雨淋侵。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":6599,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"浣溪纱 赠琼孙","author":"陈世祥","text":"自是缑山品绝伦。\n珠匀玉莹想风神。\n乳名直得唤珍珍。\n摒当笔床都蕴藉，捧持酒盏更温文。\n越歌应不忿庄辛。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":6600,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"恋情深 赠妓","author":"陈世祥","text":"掩袖留香香未许。\n弱烟如绪。\n双丝花罅透云痕。\n欲销魂。\n低鬟小语不教闻。\n鹊脑为郎温。\n微雨浅寒吹户，烛黄昏。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":6601,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"归国遥 楼上","author":"陈世祥","text":"非误。\n沙觜水痕游子路。\n只为远山相护。\n把行人隔住。\n看得暮云栖树。\n晚风都似絮。\n又是归鸦无数。\n伤心和影诉。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":6602,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"巫山一段云 四月二十日","author":"陈世祥","text":"是客云为梦，飘零惜去年。\n断魂曾泥酒尊前。\n衣带镇相怜。\n旧曲闲翻谱，新声自注笺。\n小窗心性夕阳天。\n幽意若为传。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":6603,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"减字木兰花 晚闺","author":"陈世祥","text":"愁人只影。\n燕怕凄凉归不肯。\n却去花间。\n展转空将翎翅翻。\n恼人明月。\n悄地来窥藏不迭。\n待向房中。\n又是清清冷被笼。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":6604,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"减字木兰花 独坐","author":"陈世祥","text":"曲栏新竹。\n一碧碾成千个玉。\n静掩篱门。\n野鸟声声乱唤人。\n绿阴如许。\n小袂轻凉疑坠雨。\n闲谱诗余。\n遍向芭蕉叶上书。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":6605,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"减字木兰花 自遣","author":"陈世祥","text":"忆春无几。\n愁到而今今夏矣。\n万顷寒云。\n夏已赊秋二十分。\n愁怀抖乱。\n晴雨难凭谁可断。\n雨意如疑。\n点滴都无丝又丝。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":6606,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"减字木兰花 题宗梅岑小香居士像，同王西樵作","author":"陈世祥","text":"吟情如许。\n日向人间题好句。\n谁信屯亶。\n老矣吾徒三十年。\n重寻旧稿。\n人道君家当日好。\n问取图中。\n却逊吟情老更工。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":6607,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"菩萨蛮 闺怨","author":"陈世祥","text":"落花万片如堪数。\n和烟织就相思缕。\n甚处叫黄鹂。\n黄鹂却叫谁。\n游丝无个事。\n只管随花住。\n归燕斗人愁。\n双双踏玉钩。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":6608,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"菩萨蛮 社集看菊","author":"陈世祥","text":"庭无凡卉花坛净。\n小阑披拂随花性。\n大釂总深觞。\n花容入酒黄。\n翠红兼艳紫。\n白更佳如此。\n醉倒便花前。\n携花伴月眠。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":6609,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"菩萨蛮 客夜","author":"陈世祥","text":"冷风索索寻窗纸。\n那堪更是廉纤雨。\n半睡过黄昏。\n残灯偏着人。\n闲愁无可破。\n梦里成真个。\n醒睡总来难。\n双眸枕上干。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":6610,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"菩萨蛮 题闺人绣幅","author":"陈世祥","text":"倪迂戏写秋山稿。\n两间茅屋霜林晓。\n屋后枕高滩。\n萧萧竹几竿。\n指尖聊染渲。\n直作针神看。\n小置画图中。\n香闺一夜工。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":6611,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"菩萨蛮 夜饮梅花阁，用前韵却赠主人","author":"陈世祥","text":"寻幽每爱郊园净。\n晴郊得尽风云性。\n新酿恰浮觞。\n充盘一楙黄。\n斓斑枫遍紫。\n悔不秋来此。\n一夕抵从前。\n更深仍未眠。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":6612,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"菩萨蛮 赠友人","author":"陈世祥","text":"句拈本色求圆净。\n柳周香艳词天性。\n佳句引传觞。\n秦欧自压黄。\n选花黄白紫。\n馀色何堪此。\n更要索从前。\n挑灯共不眠。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":6613,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"菩萨蛮 幽晤","author":"陈世祥","text":"上弦月落黄昏院。\n惊人乍似双飞燕。\n已是出来难。\n疏屏又夜寒。\n拼得相思各。\n莫更人前谑。\n欲语转娇睛。\n知卿梦里曾。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":6614,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"菩萨蛮 闵际行花乳茶","author":"陈世祥","text":"仙人高掌空青雨。\n玉蓉几点花头乳。\n一叶乍沉瓯。\n春云自在流。\n兰香谁可赠。\n已证松萝圣。\n瑞草陋阳坡。\n除非访穆陀。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":6615,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"诉衷情 本意","author":"陈世祥","text":"痴云痴雨宠风姨。\n庭草尽情肥。\n说来一春花事，都是恼人时。\n花里坐，看花飞。\n敛双眉。\n多情燕子，片片飞花，拾上香泥。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":6616,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"谒金门 晚寒","author":"陈世祥","text":"衣索索。\n早被晚风知觉。\n穿过绣帘来作恶。\n故欺人软弱。\n烛短香轻衾薄。\n游子天涯无诺。\n不记新秋珍重约。\n共谁人恋着。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":6617,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"谒金门 晚醉","author":"陈世祥","text":"无事好。\n长得一庭芳草。\n放着闲云闲不扫。\n闭门云杳杳。\n兴到酒瓢独舀。\n便向苍苔醉倒。\n睡起斜阳刚一觉。\n掀髯还独笑。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":6618,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"好事近 山寺晓步","author":"陈世祥","text":"细雨润园蔬，蔬甲一时如镞。\n插槿篱门还闭，有高人睡足。\n竹溪是处笋成林，新笋青于玉。\n倦向溪边小坐，已尘襟都浴。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":6619,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"好事近 夏闺","author":"陈世祥","text":"晓倦起来迟，已是蜂衙将散。\n燕子一双私语，落衔来花瓣。\n云头雨过响棱棱，打檐花冰绽。\n又早半天晴碧，写峰峦千万。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":6620,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"更漏子 秋雨","author":"陈世祥","text":"漏声残，灯影碎。\n一个人儿怎睡。\n闲绣被，冷香篝。\n孤帏见也羞。\n芭蕉树。\n芭蕉雨。\n恰似和谁共语。\n雨滴沥，泪栏杆。\n相陪消夜寒。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":6621,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"忆秦娥 美人足。以下三首社集分赋 其一","author":"陈世祥","text":"双莲小。\n是伊行处成香草。\n成香草。\n一弯三寸，量来还少。\n午帘小立苔声悄。\n绿阶点定相思稿。\n相思稿。\n若教掌上，着人情饱。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":6622,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"忆秦娥 其二 美人发","author":"陈世祥","text":"才出幔。\n玄云拖缕舒来缓。\n舒来缓。\n手围坠地，八盘加半。\n香丝腻玉妆台畔。\n约鬟未就嗔郎唤。\n嗔郎唤。\n枕函兰泽，怎教批判。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":6623,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"忆秦娥 其三 美人腰","author":"陈世祥","text":"香罗幅。\n柳丝一尺围红玉。\n围红玉。\n泥人入抱，刚刚如束。\n欠伸无力牵郎宿。\n欲扶不得娇难掬。\n娇难掬。\n回身笑睨，怕他明烛。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":6624,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"忆秦娥 东昌道中有怀","author":"陈世祥","text":"天边月。\n相思准备和他说。\n和他说。\n清光分照，料应关切。\n风知帘缝勾香泄。\n西楼月转鸣蛩咽。\n鸣蛩咽。\n月儿不管，闷怀空结。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":6625,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"忆秦娥 次梅木山夜坐韵","author":"陈世祥","text":"和愁织。\n络丝整夕无休息。\n无休息。\n睡乡佳境，怎生甜黑。\n秋情如故人非昔。\n灯光闪闪尖风勒。\n尖风勒。\n照人憔悴，这般颜色。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":6626,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"清平乐 雪","author":"陈世祥","text":"云僵风败。\n雪意妆来大。\n梅影一窗摇浅墨。\n陡地幻成银海。\n前村樵径都迷。\n诗人驴背才归。\n忙唤童儿买酒，板桥西畔还西。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":6627,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"清平乐 次尤展成春闺韵","author":"陈世祥","text":"嗔花怨草。\n怎得心情好。\n几日小姑猜着了。\n故意诵郎诗稿。\n愁来压梦难醒。\n背人偏要潜行。\n却被东风一吓，回廊敲动风筝。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":6628,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"清平乐 新柳","author":"陈世祥","text":"十三娇女。\n约略腰如许。\n尽日临风摇弱缕。\n无力向人前舞。\n小桥正枕横塘。\n高楼都在斜阳。\n寄语东风且慢，莫教轻换鹅黄。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":6629,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"阮郎归 踏春","author":"陈世祥","text":"宿花蝴蝶惹花飞。\n纱窗闻画眉。\n女儿生小在香闺。\n开箱怜舞衣。\n添线倦，卷帘迟。\n栏杆让柳垂。\n邻家相约踏春堤。\n日长缓缓归。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":6630,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}}]